485
01:05:01.370 --> 01:05:09.670
John Talburt: are not satisfying building… I'm sorry, creating value for the user, then I don't have information quality.

486
01:05:10.270 --> 01:05:11.890
John Talburt: Only data quality.

487
01:05:12.450 --> 01:05:16.719
John Talburt: So… What we're trying to do is close this gap.

488
01:05:17.190 --> 01:05:20.100
John Talburt: And say, don't just consider the data.

489
01:05:20.400 --> 01:05:25.090
